<title>UK: Little movement seen in lethargic LME pre-market.</title>
<headline>Little movement seen in lethargic LME pre-market.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Little changed after 1,800-tonne stocks decline. Backwardation edging out to $121/125.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Ignores 2,650-tonne inventory fall. Lacklustre around overnight levels.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Off lows, aided by modest stock fall. Mulls Inco impasse where strike shows no sign of ending.</p>
</text>
